From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:38:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] prf-mac final: the bound and Theorem 135.4

PRFMAC.accept_forgeGame_eq (the forgery game of a MAC with a deterministic tag) and
PRFMAC.exists_forgeGame_le (Pr[forge] <= prfAdv (F n) (D^{q*1+1}) + 2^{-n} at every n for a MAC
whose tag is a keyed family); prfMAC_secure proved from it with PRF.negligible_prfAdv,
Negligible.add and negligible_two_pow_neg. The owned file: title, main results, contents and
the proof sketch describe the delivered proof.
